/K [11]
>>
endobj
247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (\(i\) Draw any vertical line AB as directrix.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
248 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (\(ii\) At any point C on it, draw the axis perpendicular to the AB \(directrix\).)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (\(iii\) Mark a focus F on the axis such that CF = 50 mm.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (\(iv\) Divide CF into 5 equal divisions \(sum of numerator and denometer of the eccentricity.\).)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (\(v\) Mark the vertex V on the third division-point from C )
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Thus, eccentricity,   e = \(VF\)/\(VC\) = 2/3)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
